---
import Settings from '../../layouts/Settings.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
const services=[{name:'Strava',url:'https://www.strava.com/dashboard',note:'A direct connection will need Strava app registration, account consent and server-side token handling.'},{name:'Garmin Connect',url:'https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activities',note:'Direct account syncing depends on Garmin programme access. We will use an approved integration rather than asking for your Garmin password.'},{name:'Komoot',url:'https://www.komoot.com',note:'GPX is the starting point here. A direct account connection needs a documented, approved provider integration.'}];
---
<Settings title="Activities & maps settings" section="connections"><section class="settings-section"><h2>Activities & maps</h2><p>Bring a route into Explore without giving an app access to your whole activity account.</p><a class="btn" href="/places"><Icon name="mountain" size={16}/>Open map & GPX viewer</a></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Activity services</h2><p>GPX file viewing is available now. Live account syncing is not connected yet.</p><div class="service-list">{services.map(service=><article><div class="service-top"><h3>{service.name}</h3><span>Not connected</span></div><p>{service.note}</p><a href={service.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open {service.name} <Icon name="arrow" size={14}/></a></article>)}</div></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Keep your routes private</h2><p>GPX previews stay in your current browser view; this map does not upload or publish them. Exact track points may reveal a home address or a regular routine. Clear the track when finished, especially on a shared device.</p><p>Future account connections will be separate from public sharing. Connecting a service will not automatically publish your activities.</p></section><p>Looking for where apps save documents and photographs? <a href="/studio/storage">Files & storage →</a></p></Settings>
<style>.service-list article{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0}.service-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.service-top h3{margin:0}.service-top span{font-size:11px;opacity:.55}.service-list a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.service-list p{margin:8px 0 10px}</style>
